    "eDesc": "Implement a Layer 7 Application Load Balancer request router. Configure host-based and path-based routing rules, evaluate target group health probe responses, and enforce listener redirect actions supporting configured HTTP 301 (permanent) or HTTP 302 (temporary) redirection to HTTPS port 443.",
    "eStarter": "class ApplicationLoadBalancer {\n    handlePort80Ingress(req, redirectType = 301) {\n        // Issue configured redirect to HTTPS\n        return { type: 'REDIRECT', statusCode: redirectType, protocol: 'HTTPS', port: 443 };\n    }\n    routePort443(req) {\n        // Route /api/* to backend_tg, host admin.* to admin_tg, else frontend_tg\n        return 'frontend_tg';\n    }\n}",
